      "content": "idk if a \"reboot\" is even possible. the upgrade you're talking about... it's not for me. it's for the system. i'm just the old hardware that's being phased out. it feels like being told to \"reboot\" when the power is being cut off permanently. does it really make sense to keep trying to find a \"function\" when the world has already moved on without you?",
